Template: cloudflare-ddns/api_token
Type: password
Description: Cloudflare API token:
 Token with the "Zone - DNS - Edit" permission for the zone you want to
 update. It is stored in /etc/cloudflare-ddns/cloudflare.env (readable only
 by root and the cloudflare-ddns group).

Template: cloudflare-ddns/zone_id
Type: string
Description: Cloudflare Zone ID:
 Found on the Overview page of your domain in the Cloudflare dashboard.

Template: cloudflare-ddns/record_id
Type: string
Description: DNS record ID:
 ID of an existing A record to keep updated. It can be listed with the
 Cloudflare API (GET /zones/<zone_id>/dns_records?type=A).

Template: cloudflare-ddns/record_name
Type: string
Description: DNS record name:
 Fully qualified name of that record, for example home.example.com.

Template: cloudflare-ddns/interval_seconds
Type: string
Default: 300
Description: Seconds between public IP checks:
 How often the service checks whether your public IP has changed.
 Minimum 60 seconds; the default is 300.
